  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Superbly positioned on an elevated, flat corner site at the junction of Gull Lane and Sunrise Avenue, this 827m² (more or less) freehold section in the Mixed Housing Suburban zone offers exceptional potential and boasts sea views. Its commanding position, wide frontage and premium corner profile make it ideal for development, rebuilding, or long-term investment etc. \r\n\r\nThe location is simply unbeatable — within walking distance to Rangitoto College, as well as Murrays Bay Primary and Intermediate. You are also close to beautiful local beaches, Mairangi Bay Village, cafés, restaurants, and everyday amenities. Public transport and motorway access are convenient, and Albany Shopping Centre is only 10 minutes away. \r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a flat, elevated corner site in this premium school zone are incredibly rare. According to the Auckland Council website, and with reference to Council Plan Change 120, buyers are strongly advised to undertake their own due diligence. Do your research, speak with your architect and bank, and act quickly, the vendors are absolutely committed to sell!",
